/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (With the rapid advancement of AI, deepfake videos created using techniques like Generative Adversarial Networks \(GANs\) have become highly realistic and harmful. Most existing detection systems analyze only frame-level \(spatial\) features and ignore temporal inconsistencies, reducing accuracy. Hence, a robust real-time system that analyzes both spatial and temporal features is needed to accurately detect deepfakes.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
