/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 201 0 R
/E ( Proposed detecting deepfakes by measuring inconsistencies in 3D head pose estimation. Deepfake faces often have a different orientation than the actual head, which becomes detectable through landmark-based pose estimation. Achieved ~89% accuracy on FaceForensics++ dataset.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
