/S /H1
/P 202 0 R
/T ([3] Capsule-Forensics: Using Capsule Networks to Detect Forged Images and Videos Nguyen et al., ICASSP 2019 DOI: 10.1109/ICASSP.2019.8682602  Applied Capsule Networks to learn part-relationship features in face images, rather than relying on global texture patterns. Showed that capsule networks are more robust to affine transformations. Achieved competitive accuracy on GAN-generated and face-swap deepfakes. Gap identified: Capsule networks are computationally expensive and do not model temporal sequences.)
/E ([3] Capsule-Forensics: Using Capsule Networks to Detect Forged Images and Videos Nguyen et al., ICASSP 2019 DOI: 10.1109/ICASSP.2019.8682602  Applied Capsule Networks to learn part-relationship features in face images, rather than relying on global texture patterns. Showed that capsule networks are more robust to affine transformations. Achieved competitive accuracy on GAN-generated and face-swap deepfakes. Gap identified: Capsule networks are computationally expensive and do not model temporal sequences.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
300 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 202 0 R
/T ([4] MesoNet: A Compact Facial Video Forgery Detection Network Afchar et al., WIFS 2018 DOI: 10.1109/WIFS.2018.8630761  Proposed a lightweight CNN architecture specifically designed for deepfake detection with minimal parameters \(MesoInception-4\). Focused on mesoscopic properties of images. Achieved ~98% on Deepfakes and ~95% on Face2Face under low compression.  Gap identified: Lightweight architecture trades accuracy for speed; performs poorly on highquality GAN-based fakes.)
/E ([4] MesoNet: A Compact Facial Video Forgery Detection Network Afchar et al., WIFS 2018 DOI: 10.1109/WIFS.2018.8630761  Proposed a lightweight CNN architecture specifically designed for deepfake detection with minimal parameters \(MesoInception-4\). Focused on mesoscopic properties of images. Achieved ~98% on Deepfakes and ~95% on Face2Face under low compression.  Gap identified: Lightweight architecture trades accuracy for speed; performs poorly on highquality GAN-based fakes.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
