/Title ([3] Capsule-Forensics: Using Capsule Networks to Detect Forged Images and Videos Nguyen et al., ICASSP 2019 DOI: 10.1109/ICASSP.2019.8682602  Applied Capsule Networks to learn part-relationship features in face images, rather than relying on global texture patterns. Showed that capsule networks are more robust to affine transformations. Achieved competitive accuracy on GAN-generated and face-swap deepfakes. Gap identified: Capsule networks are computationally expensive and do not model temporal sequences.)
