/Title ([4] MesoNet: A Compact Facial Video Forgery Detection Network Afchar et al., WIFS 2018 DOI: 10.1109/WIFS.2018.8630761  Proposed a lightweight CNN architecture specifically designed for deepfake detection with minimal parameters \(MesoInception-4\). Focused on mesoscopic properties of images. Achieved ~98% on Deepfakes and ~95% on Face2Face under low compression.  Gap identified: Lightweight architecture trades accuracy for speed; performs poorly on highquality GAN-based fakes.)
